  "prefLabel": "Rev 2601.03 Governmental unit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2601.03 “Governmental unit” means any:\n\n(a) State legislative body;\n\n(b) State or municipal department;\n\n(c) Commission;\n\n(d) Board;\n\n(e) Institution;\n\n(f) Bureau;\n\n(g) Agency;\n\n(h) Instrumentality;\n\n(i) State universities created by statute;\n\n(j) County;\n\n(k) City;\n\n(l) Town;\n\n(m) School district;\n\n(n) School administrative unit;\n\n(o) Village district; or\n\n(p) Unincorporated place.\n\nSource. #7479, eff 4-24-01; ss by #9443, eff 4-1-09; ss by #12138, eff 3-22-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2600.html"
